  "citation": "Walker A P; Kauwe M G D; Medlyn B; Zaehle S; Asao S; Guenet B; Harper A; Hickler T; Jain A K; Luo Y; Lu X; Luus K; Shu S; Wang Y; Werner C; Xia J; Norby R J (2018): FACE-MDS Phase 2: Model Output. Free Air CO2 Enrichment Model Data Synthesis (FACE-MDS). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1480327",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
    "@type": "Dataset",
    "@id": "doi:10.15485/1480327",
    "name": "FACE-MDS Phase 2: Model Output",
    "description": [
      "Model output from Phase 2 of the Free Air CO2 Enrichment Model Data Synthesis (FACE-MDS) project. Results from 12 models simulating six elevated CO2 experiments using the protocols, met data, and other data supplied in the accompanying dataset: Phase 2 Free Air CO2 Enrichment Model-Data Synthesis: Meteorological Data and Protocols. File naming convention can be found in the file 'facemds-file-table-modeldata.xml' and information about variable naming convention can be found in the file 'facemds-standard-name-table-modvars.xml'. We followed the ALMA v3 convention for meteorological variables and developed a hierarchical naming scheme for ecosystem variables. Additional info can be found in the protocols in the accompanying meteorological dataset (doi:10.15485/1480328). We replaced the original naming convention mentioned in the protocol with the one described in 'facemds-standard-name-table-modvars.xml'."
    ],
